	@startuml
	title Dependency Management Flow Before This Project
	skinparam shadowing false
	skinparam monochrome true

	start
	:Open Azure DevOps manually;
	:Find the starting work item;

	repeat
		:Check related pull requests;
		:Check linked work items and child work items;
		:Open the next related result;
		:Repeat the same navigation manually;
	repeat while (More related items to inspect?) is (yes)

	:Collect all related commits manually;
	:Open each commit in its repository;
	:Check branches or tags to guess the version;
	:Compare the findings across repositories;
	:Write the final conclusion manually;
	stop

	note right
	Before this project, the developer had to trace the chain manually.
	The same search was repeated until nothing new was found.
	The final dependency conclusion depended on manual checking.
	end note

	@enduml